zgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:02:01.00,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalışmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:55.01,0:01:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay canına!Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.97,0:02:01.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz korsanların ilginç numaraları varmış!Dialogue: 50,0:02:01.73,0:02:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana da öğretsene!Dialogue: 50,0:02:05.31,0:02:06.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.81,0:02:09.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey... Alo?Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.78,0:02:11.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.36,0:02:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-N-N-N-Ne?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:13.32,0:02:15.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:02:15.16,0:02:16.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'oldu birdenbire?Dialogue: 50,0:02:16.95,0:02:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha demin o kadar eğleniyordun!Dialogue: 50,0:02:20.95,0:02:22.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yoksa öl–Dialogue: 50,0:02:22.96,0:02:28.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aç gözlerini, Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:02:31.63,0:02:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İçim geçmiş.Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.97,0:02:36.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korkutmasana beni! Kalbime iniyordu!Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.01,0:02:38.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özür dilerim. İsteyerek olmadı.Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.76,0:02:41.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok endişelendim!Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.89,0:02:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen yok musun? Geceyi sonlandıralım mı?Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.02,0:02:48.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de yorulmuşa benziyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.27,0:02:50.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne diyorsun, Yamato?Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.07,0:02:52.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daha sana anlatacak tonla şeyim var!Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.40,0:02:57.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabahleyin benimkilerle buluşacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.28,0:02:59.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geceyi uyuyarak heba etmeyelim.Dialogue: 50,0:03:03.00,0:03:05.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir daha sızmak yok o zaman!Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.16,0:03:07.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özür diledim ya.Dialogue: 50,0:03:07.04,0:03:09.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki nerede kalmıştık?Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.29,0:03:12.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine kardeşini anlatıyordun.Dialogue: 50,0:03:12.92,0:03:17.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen de yine Oden olmak istediğini söylüyordun.Dialogue: 50,0:03:18.05,0:03:19.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanlışın var, Ace.Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.35,0:03:22.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmak istemiyorum, olacağım.Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir gün gerçek olacak bir hayal.Dialogue: 50,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu...Dialogue: 50,0:03:26.56,0:03:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bizim geleceğimiz!Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.69,0:03:31.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D. mi?Dialogue: 50,0:03:35.32,0:03:39.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir gün seninle tanışacağım hiç aklıma gelmezdi.Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.03,0:03:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"O-Oden"...Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.91,0:03:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babamın defteri mi o?Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.46,0:03:51.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dolu dolu yaşantısı ve dünyayı keşfinin tüm ayrıntıları bu defterde yer alıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.63,0:03:56.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Malum gün, bunu Oden Kalesi'nin oradaki nehirden aldım.Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.05,0:04:00.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biri bunu yangından kurtarmış.Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama'nın...Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.89,0:04:05.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun!Dialogue: 50,0:04:06.35,0:04:10.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seninle ilgili de birçok şey yazıyor.Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.23,0:04:15.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal'ın gemisinde doğmuşsun!Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.44,0:04:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sonra da Roger'ın gemisine gitmişsin.Dialogue: 50,0:04:18.49,0:04:19.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hıhı.Dialogue: 50,0:04:20.41,0:04:26.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama çok küçük olduğumdan hiç hatırlamıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.70,0:04:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal, Roger ve Oden.Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.96,0:04:31.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ortak bir şey söylediler...Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.04,0:04:34.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Bundan en az 20 yıl sonra...Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.50,0:04:39.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,genç ve güçlü korsanlar birbiri ardına Yeni Dünya'ya gelecek."Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.26,0:04:40.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O vakit geldi!Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.47,0:04:49.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onların başının da Ace olacağına inanıyordum.Dialogue: 50,0:04:50.44,0:04:54.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama o öldüğünde bir şeyi hatırladım.Dialogue: 50,0:04:55.11,0:04:56.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O gece dediği bir şeyi!Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.57,0:05:00.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne...?Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.78,0:05:04.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hass...Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.16,0:05:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ağzımdan kaçırdım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:05.74,0:05:08.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanlışlıkla söyledim.Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.45,0:05:10.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunu demedim sayalım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak gülme,Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.71,0:05:14.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sabo'yla ben çok kızarız.Dialogue: 50,0:05:16.00,0:05:19.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ülkeden hiç çıkmadım.Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.51,0:05:23.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendi gözlerimle gördüğüm hiçbir şey yok.Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.39,0:05:28.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace'in kardeşi olsun, Oden'in gezdiği geniş dünya olsun...Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.56,0:05:33.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama o an gözlerim...Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.15,0:05:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,net biçimde bir şey gördü!Dialogue: 50,0:05:35.98,0:05:39.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşimin hayali bu.Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.07,0:05:46.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir gün denize açılalım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.08,0:05:50.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu ülkeden kurtulup özgürce yaşayalım!Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.58,0:05:55.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geniş dünyayı görmek ve bu konuda bir kitap yazmak istiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.88,0:05:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rotacılık dersi verseler hiç sıkılmadan çalışırım.Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.88,0:06:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kendimizi geliştirip günün birinde korsan olalım!Dialogue: 50,0:06:04.30,0:06:07.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Söylemesen olmayacaktım sanki.Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.93,0:06:14.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlığa soyunup önüme geleni yenecek ve en büyük ben olacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.06,0:06:17.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaşadığımın kanıtı olur işte.Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.94,0:06:23.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm dünya varlığımı reddetse de benden nefret etse de...Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.53,0:06:26.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yine de tarihe geçecek bir korsan olacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.58,0:06:31.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hükûmet diyor ki koca bir hazinenin yattığı...Dialogue: 50,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,son adaya gitmeyin.Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.33,0:06:38.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu da insanı daha çok çekiyor.Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.17,0:06:42.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oraya ulaşırsak namımız alır başını gider.Dialogue: 50,0:06:42.80,0:06:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünyanın en büyüğü oluruz!Dialogue: 50,0:06:45.76,0:06:47.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünyanın en büyüğü mü?Dialogue: 50,0:06:49.51,0:06:51.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çok iyi!Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.22,0:06:53.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman...Dialogue: 50,0:06:53.39,0:06:55.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet,Dialogue: 50,0:06:55.06,0:06:56.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,o zaman...Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.90,0:07:02.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– ...ben de... – Ben de...Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.78,0:07:09.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ciddi ciddi dinliyorum bir de.Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.66,0:07:11.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çocukça bir düş bu!Dialogue: 50,0:07:13.41,0:07:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bayılıyorum sana, Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:07:15.92,0:07:19.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl biri olacağını görmek için can atıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.22,0:07:32.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy bunu dediğinde Sabo'yla gülmüştük.Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.10,0:07:35.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama başkasının gülmesine izin vermeyiz.Dialogue: 50,0:07:35.48,0:07:37.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ona inanıyoruz çünkü.Dialogue: 50,0:07:37.10,0:07:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onda bu potansiyel var, bu yüzden–Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.86,0:07:41.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.73,0:07:44.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.36,0:07:46.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.49,0:07:47.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyin var, Yamato?Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.87,0:07:53.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben gülmeyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.58,0:07:58.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar Kralı da aynısını demişti!Dialogue: 50,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.09,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden de çok etkilenmişti!Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.09,0:08:07.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yolculuğu sırasında Kozuki Oden de aynısını diyen büyük bir adam görmüş.Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.30,0:08:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayatta gülmem!Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.93,0:08:10.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşin inanılmaz biri!Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.81,0:08:14.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Büyük adam ha?Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.43,0:08:15.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyiymiş.Dialogue: 50,0:08:15.93,0:08:19.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'yle beraber bir gün onunla içeriz umarım.Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.56,0:08:22.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aranızdan su sızmazdı kesin.Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.32,0:08:24.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Çoktan ölmeseydi.Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.57,0:08:25.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öldü mü?Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.19,0:08:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yazık oldu. Kadeh tokuşturamayacağız.Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.70,0:08:32.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayırdır?Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.99,0:08:34.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi ne var?Dialogue: 50,0:08:35.12,0:08:36.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şey,Dialogue: 50,0:08:36.37,0:08:38.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,onun yerine ben gelsem olur mu?Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.04,0:08:42.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen, kardeşin ve ben!Dialogue: 50,0:08:42.29,0:08:45.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne bileyim, bir gün denize açılırsam falan...Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.05,0:08:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bomba olur.Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.67,0:08:47.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sahiden mi?Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.67,0:08:50.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki Yamato, deniz ne kadar büyük biliyor musun?Dialogue: 50,0:08:50.68,0:08:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elini çabuk tutmazsan birbirimizi bir daha göremeyiz.Dialogue: 50,0:08:54.43,0:08:55.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O hâlde Ace,Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.43,0:08:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,tırnağından bir parça veya...Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.68,0:08:59.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bir tutam saçını verir misin?Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.48,0:09:00.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.77,0:09:03.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İkisinden birini ver işte!Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.27,0:09:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam.Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.40,0:09:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh?Dialogue: 50,0:09:11.82,0:09:12.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bitirdim.Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.57,0:09:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.24,0:09:15.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu senin vivre kartın.Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.20,0:09:17.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu muymuş?Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.71,0:09:21.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bildiğin kağıt parçası bu ya.Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.92,0:09:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, bu kağıt parçası bizi tekrar bir araya getirecek.Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.09,0:09:28.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl olacak o iş?Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.09,0:09:29.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak.Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.22,0:09:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ayrılmak istemediğin ya da tekrar görmek istediğin birine bundan bir parça ver.Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.73,0:09:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anladım!Dialogue: 50,0:09:41.60,0:09:43.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öyle yaparım.Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.25,0:10:00.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato!Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.75,0:10:05.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sakın kaybetme onu!Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.27,0:10:24.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.44,0:10:34.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.49,0:10:40.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekrar görüşelim...Dialogue: 50,0:10:40.95,0:10:43.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace!Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.17,0:10:53.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.06,0:11:01.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama...Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.97,0:11:04.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bu onu son görüşümdü.Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.07,0:11:15.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hıyar oğlan gene rahat durmuyor.Dialogue: 50,0:11:15.86,0:11:20.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neyse, Kızıl Saç yüzünden şu an boş vaktim var.Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.16,0:11:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öfke krizini ben bastırırım.Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.46,0:11:31.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tekrar uğrayacağını söylemiştin.Dialogue: 50,0:11:37.13,0:11:39.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neye tutunduğunun önemi yok.Dialogue: 50,0:11:55.86,0:11:59.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl olsa bu adadan...Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,gidemez.Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.66,0:12:09.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu adadan ayrılamıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.21,0:12:12.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babamın hakkından gelemiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:12:14.84,0:12:17.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tek arkadaşımı...Dialogue: 50,0:12:18.34,0:12:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,gidip kurtaramıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.01,0:12:23.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben...Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.22,0:12:27.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,özgür değilim.Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.89,0:12:31.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne diye kalbine de zincir vurduruyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.56,0:12:34.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de...Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.48,0:12:37.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden gibi özgürce yaşamak istiyorum...Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.78,0:12:40.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace...Dialogue: 50,0:12:42.41,0:12:45.79,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bundan en az 20 yıl sonra...Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.79,0:12:52.00,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,gelecek çağa öncülük edecek genç ve güçlü korsanlar, birbiri ardına Yeni Dünya'ya gelecek.Dialogue: 50,0:12:52.42,0:12:56.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama en adından söz edilecek adam birkaç yıla gelecek.Dialogue: 50,0:12:57.05,0:12:59.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşim olur kendisi!Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri dön, Yamato.Dialogue: 50,0:13:07.60,0:13:12.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Oden'in beklediği şeyi ben de bekleyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.19,0:13:15.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lütfen geri dönün, Genç Efendi Yamato!Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.03,0:13:18.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelecek çağı bekleyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.78,0:13:20.07,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne kadar sürerse sürsün.Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.41,0:13:22.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy,Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.78,0:13:24.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,seni bekleyeceğim.Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.74,0:13:26.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama o güne kadar ben...Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.45,0:13:31.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Laftan anladığın yoksa...Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.67,0:13:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,kafana vura vura sokacağım, Yamato.Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.50,0:13:38.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...asla yılmayacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.31,0:13:48.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha şöyle, Yamato!Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.97,0:13:53.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben Oden'im, uyuz ihtiyar!Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.90,0:14:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O gün dış dünyada neler olup bittiğini bilmesem de...Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.91,0:14:05.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,olanları daha sonra gazeteden okudum.Dialogue: 50,0:14:06.24,0:14:10.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ace'in Korsanlar Kralı Gol D. Roger'ın oğlu olduğunu...Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.62,0:14:16.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve kardeşinin cidden korsan olup nam yaptığını öğrendim.Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.34,0:14:19.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kardeşi senin buraya getirdiğin Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.17,0:14:22.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun.Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.26,0:14:27.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hakkın olarak bunu sana veriyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.76,0:14:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in gelecek ile ilgili kaleme aldıkları bunlar...Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.31,0:14:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in gelecek ile ilgili kaleme aldıkları bunlar...Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.35,0:14:32.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in gelecek ile ilgili kaleme aldıkları bunlar...Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.43,0:14:32.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in gelecek ile ilgili kaleme aldıkları bunlar...Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.48,0:14:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in gelecek ile ilgili kaleme aldıkları bunlar...Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.02,0:14:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Bundan en az 20 yıl sonra...Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.95,0:14:46.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,gelecek çağa öncülük edecek genç ve güçlü korsanlar...Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.95,0:14:49.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,birbiri ardına Yeni Dünya'ya gelecek."Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Şayet ölürsem...Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.58,0:14:59.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yu onlar devirecek!"Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.63,0:15:06.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One Piece...Dialogue: 50,0:15:08.30,0:15:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz onun için yarışmanın hayalini bile kuramazsınız.Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.44,0:15:22.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hâlâ korsancılık mı oynamak istiyorsunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.94,0:15:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ders vermede berbatsın, Kaido.Dialogue: 50,0:15:26.91,0:15:28.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bırak ben yapayım.Dialogue: 50,0:15:34.08,0:15:36.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet, biliyorum Killer...Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.67,0:15:39.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hislerini anlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.25,0:15:42.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin için bunca şey getirdim!Dialogue: 50,0:15:46.30,0:15:49.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kabul edin, Yonkolar!Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.90,0:16:05.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Işığı gören geliyor!Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.65,0:16:07.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pek bir başına buyruksun.Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.61,0:16:09.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm Hasır Şapkalar böyle mi?Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.74,0:16:12.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Suçlusu ben değilim.Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.62,0:16:15.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En başına buyruğu göremiyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.70,0:16:17.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-ya nerede?Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.46,0:16:24.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sayıları artıp duruyor.Dialogue: 50,0:16:24.21,0:16:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,En Kötü Nesil değil mi bunlar?Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.59,0:16:30.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rüzgârda uçan toz gibi dağılacaklar.Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.85,0:16:38.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz bu yarayı açacak seviyede değilsiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.23,0:16:45.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usulca geri çekilin çaylak bozuntuları.Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.94,0:16:48.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızıl Kınlar gibi.Dialogue: 50,0:16:58.87,0:17:03.04,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bundan en az 20 yıl sonra...Dialogue: 50,0:17:07.17,0:17:14.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,gelecek çağa öncülük edecek genç ve güçlü korsanlar, birbiri ardına Yeni Dünya'ya gelecek.Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.85,0:17:18.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Şayet ölürsem...Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.23,0:17:18.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Şayet ölürsem...Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.35,0:17:18.43,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Şayet ölürsem...Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.35,0:17:25.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yu...Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.78,0:17:28.74,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,onlar devirecek!Dialogue: 50,0:17:29.36,0:17:31.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biri daha geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.36,0:17:33.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz oturun, ben hallederim.Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.62,0:17:34.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Reddediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.12,0:17:34.83,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben de.Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.49,0:17:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kellesini almalık ne çok kişi geldi.Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.37,0:17:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka.Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.43,0:18:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Linlin!Dialogue: 50,0:18:00.68,0:18:04.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bil bakalım bu velet karşıma geçip ne olacağım demiştir.Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Küstahın teki.Dialogue: 50,0:18:07.36,0:18:10.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana da haddini aşan sözler söyledi.Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.94,0:18:14.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kalemi de yerle bir etti.Dialogue: 50,0:18:14.57,0:18:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Önce özür dile, Hasır Şapka.Dialogue: 50,0:18:22.96,0:18:24.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan velet.Dialogue: 50,0:18:24.96,0:18:28.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karşımızdayken...Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.80,0:18:33.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ne olacaksın bir daha söyle hele!Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.81,0:18:42.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Size güveniyoruz...Dialogue: 50,0:18:44.69,0:18:45.85,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-dono!Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.36,0:18:52.32,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Minnettarız!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.75,0:19:04.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misin, Kin'emon?Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Özür dilerim.Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.79,0:19:10.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geç kaldım.Dialogue: 50,0:19:17.80,0:19:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P... Perişanım.Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.52,0:19:25.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Öteki...Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.02,0:19:27.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dünyada...Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.36,0:19:32.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,efendime bakacak yüzüm... yok!Dialogue: 50,0:19:33.90,0:19:34.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin'e–Dialogue: 50,0:19:37.07,0:19:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'ya...Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.33,0:19:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,sahip çıkar mısın?Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.00,0:19:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya–Dialogue: 50,0:19:46.62,0:19:47.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aptal!Dialogue: 50,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette çıkarım!Dialogue: 50,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Burası dostlarımın ülkesi!Dialogue: 50,0:19:59.18,0:20:01.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan velet.Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.68,0:20:06.69,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy-dono...Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.85,0:20:11.02,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,minnettarım.Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.77,0:20:13.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Trao!Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.57,0:20:15.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepsini aşağıya yolla!Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.24,0:20:23.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine ne sarsıntısı bu?Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.29,0:20:25.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.17,0:20:34.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin haki dediğiniz şey Wano'da ryuo olarak biliniyor.Dialogue: 50,0:20:34.63,0:20:37.51,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,"Akış" anlamına geliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.51,0:20:40.72,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden-sama idam edildi!Dialogue: 50,0:20:40.72,0:20:44.93,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano şogunu tarafından, korsan Kaido'nun da yardımıyla...Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.93,0:20:44.97,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano şogunu tarafından, korsan Kaido'nun da yardımıyla...Dialogue: 50,0:20:44.97,0:20:45.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano şogunu tarafından, korsan Kaido'nun da yardımıyla...Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.02,0:20:45.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano şogunu tarafından, korsan Kaido'nun da yardımıyla...Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.52,0:20:47.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo-dono güvende!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.43,0:20:45.47,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo-dono güvende!Dialogue: 50,0:20:45.47,0:20:45.52,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Raizo-dono güvende!Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.68,0:20:49.98,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.98,0:20:49.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== We'd never sell out our friends! ===Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.98,0:20:50.02,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.02,0:20:50.06,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.06,0:20:50.10,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.10,0:20:50.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ölürüz de dostlarımızı satmayız!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.15,0:20:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,=== We'd never sell out our friends! ===Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.40,0:20:53.11,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.15,0:20:50.19,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.19,0:20:50.23,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.23,0:20:50.27,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.27,0:20:50.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.31,0:20:50.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:50.35,0:20:50.40,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinleyin! Siz-gara ilerlemeye devam etmelisiniz!Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.15,0:20:57.36,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ebisu Kasabası'nın neşeli adamı öteki dünyaya göçmek üzere!Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.11,0:20:53.15,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ebisu Kasabası'nın neşeli adamı öteki dünyaya geçmek üzere!Dialogue: 51,0:20:57.36,0:20:57.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ebisu Kasabası'nın neşeli adamı öteki dünyaya geçmek üzere!Dialogue: 50,0:20:57.36,0:21:00.66,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Henüz isyan ateşi sönmemiş demek.Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.66,0:21:02.70,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Tüm gemiler, Onigashima'ya!Dialogue: 50,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.03,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,İleri!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.50,0:21:10.42,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,20 yıl önce Oden, Kaido tarafından öldürüldüğünde...Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.42,0:21:12.83,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,bu ülke duraklama çağına girmedi mi?Dialogue: 50,0:21:12.83,0:21:15.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimse ölürken gülünmeyi hak etmez.Dialogue: 50,0:21:15.96,0:21:19.26,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yabancıyım diye ülkeyi kurtaramaz mıyım?Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.26,0:21:21.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Konuşsana! Önemli biri değil miydin?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.76,0:21:25.14,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu harika insanların lideri değil misin?!Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.14,0:21:29.31,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'yu devirmek istiyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.82,0:21:38.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lastik-Lastik...Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.82,0:21:43.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızıl...Dialogue: 50,0:21:44.53,0:21:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaya!Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.64,0:22:11.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kaido! Ne yapıyorsun?!Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.27,0:22:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen yere düşmezsin!Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.40,0:22:20.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben, Monkey D. Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.03,0:22:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizi geride bırakacak...Dialogue: 50,0:22:26.24,0:22:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve Korsanlar Kralı olacağım!Dialogue: 50,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zenginlik, şöhret, güç...Dialogue: 50,0:00:03.73,0:00:07.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünyanın sunabileceği her şeyi elde eden adam, Korsanlar Kralı, Gold Roger.Dialogue: 50,0:00:07.99,0:00:11.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Son sözleri dünyanın her yerinden maceracıları denize çekti.Dialogue: 50,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazinem mi?Dialogue: 50,0:00:13.74,0:00:15.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İstiyorsanız, alabilirsiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:00:15.58,0:00:16.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Arayıp bulun!Dialogue: 50,0:00:16.83,0:00:19.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu dünyanın sunabileceği her şeyi orada bıraktım!Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.75,0:00:26.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Artık herkes, hayallerinin peşinde Grand Line'a yelken açıyor!Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.55,0:00:29.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dünya, Büyük Korsan Çağı'na girdi!Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,ADialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,lDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,aDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,ıDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,yDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,gDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,eDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,rDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,iDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,nDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,mDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,uDialogue: 2,0:00:29.91,0:00:35.35,Lyrics,,0,0,0,fx,tD